{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once a novelist, Vincent Marlow was forced to abandon his writing after being falsely accused. Then one day, he receives a letter from Sofia, asking him to find her missing brother\u2014who disappeared in the place connected to the case that ruined his life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553670/extras/letter.gif?t=1742386921\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unknown - Raven Field is the first Episode in the Unknown series, a gripping mystery adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive Storyline: Uncover the lost memories of Sofia, Noah, and Olivia. Discover the family's forgotten past and the hidden secrets of Raven Field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles and Riddles: Search the village for hidden clues and solve puzzles to uncover the mysteries of Raven Field.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interaction with Villagers: Engage with the villagers to get closer to the truth. Dive into their words and unravel the clues they hide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eerie Atmosphere: The suspenseful background music and meticulously designed environments deepen the mystery of Raven Field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553670/extras/play.gif?t=1742386921\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3553670?t=1742386921","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3553670?t=1742386921","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553670/4c3466aa57736774821241020189943cfea30d5e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742386921","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s